#. Install guide: a dialog that walks through installing the web app on this device. A label drawn inside a small schematic of the browser's or OS's own screen: use the label that screen shows in this language, the same as in the step text. Very short: it must fit a small box in the drawing. The install dialog's confirm button.
#: client/components/InstallGuideArt.vue
msgctxt "install.art.install"
